  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Chemical Formula of Methane is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math>.</p><p>The mole percentage of carbon <math><mtext>=</mtext><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">f</mi><mtext>&#8201;&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mtext>&#8201;&#8201;</mtext></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mtext>&#8201;&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">h</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>100</mn></math></p><p><math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>100</mn></math></p><p><math><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></math></p>",
